        "@value": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"(4) Before admitting the first visitor, the organizer must give the agency either a signed paper inspection record or an electronic inspection record signed by the inspecting officer. Each record must identify the display, the inspection date, and every public exit inspected.\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"object\":\"\",\"scope_text\":\"For each inspection record given to the agency before admitting the first visitor to a temporary display open to the public after sunset on agency premises.\",\"summary\":\"Each inspection record provided to the agency must identify the display, the inspection date, and every public exit inspected.\",\"typed_values\":[]}",
